  storyText: "Short Circuit\n\nMirage fires a quickhack: Reboot Optics. Both of them stumble around blind, cursing. You grab the Quadra's keys off the hood.\n\nKaz, on his knees: \"Okay, okay! Don't flatline me!\"\n\n1. Take the car and go.\n2. Make Kaz talk."
